  "task": "Create an order fulfillment process at /home/user/Documents/swimlane_process.drawio. Create 3 header rectangles: Customer, Sales, Warehouse. Create 6 activity rectangles: Place Order, Verify Stock, Approve Sale, Pick Items, Pack Items, Ship Order. Connect sequentially: Place Order->Verify Stock->Approve Sale->Pick Items->Pack Items->Ship Order. The diagram must have at least 9 vertices and 5 edges. Save the file.",
